{%- comment -%}
  Sizes not covered by the extended returns window in the current market.
  Statutory 14 days and Adjust to Desire are never excluded.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign iso = localization.country.iso_code | default: 'GB' | upcase
  if iso == 'UK'
    assign iso = 'GB'
  endif
  assign days = settings.trial_nights | default: 100
-%}
<p>These sizes are not covered by the {{ days }} day returns policy in this market. Adjust to Desire still applies. Your statutory right to cancel within 14 days is unaffected.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Emperor, 200 × 200cm</li>
  {%- if iso == 'GB' or iso == 'IE' -%}
    <li>US King, 193 × 203cm</li>
    <li>California King, 183 × 213cm</li>
    <li>Split King, 2 × 106 × 213cm</li>
  {%- elsif iso == 'AE' -%}
    <li>Split King, 2 × 106 × 213cm</li>
  {%- endif -%}
</ul>
